res replayability<br></li><li> Hard historical fiction which rejects fantasy and popular tropes<br></li><li> Artwork in the style of an illuminated manuscript<br></li><li> Early music soundtrack based on real medieval compositions<br></li><li> Words: many fine, hand-picked words<br></li><li> Conquest and map painting, if such is your fancy</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161020/extras/895eba0cdf3da91fb932d836f8e60bcc.avif?t=1710977363\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1161020/extras/cf9861b6b2e69c1cf6a576cac5c67091.webp?t=1710977363\" /></div>",
